{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38043","headline":"余寓汀州沙县病中闻前郑左丞璘随外镇举荐赴洛兼云继有急徵旋见脂辖因作七言四韵戏以赠之或冀其感悟也 · 韩偓","name":"余寓汀州沙县病中闻前郑左丞璘随外镇举荐赴洛兼云继有急徵旋见脂辖因作七言四韵戏以赠之或冀其感悟也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫恨当年入用迟，通材何处不逢知。\n桑田变後新舟檝，华表归来旧路岐。\n公干寂寥甘坐废，子牟欢拚促行期。\n移都已改侯王第，惆怅沙堤别筑基。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}